<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A checkout bug affects one screen, but the reviewer has to trace a generic interactor and a proxy before finding the price rule. Follow the path an engineer would debug before deciding which layer earns its place.</p>

<!-- @before Staff Engineer Thinking :: staff -->
### Trace the next change

Pick a realistic change, such as adding a new discount rule. Mark the files that would change, the invariants each layer protects and where you would put the regression test. Keep a layer that owns a real boundary. Remove a layer whose only job is to pass this call through. [Google’s code review guidance](https://google.github.io/eng-practices/review/reviewer/looking-for.html#complexity).
